      "en": "For those who lead this people lead them astray; and those who are led by them are destroyed.",
      "ko": "백성을 인도하는 자가 그들로 미혹케 하니 인도를 받는 자가 멸망을 당하는도다",
      "source_text_hash": "fa714b6ae5db45f13cb682ea491b46c9c3c0ded4f7bf5aefb7d498acdc8e8814",
      "translation_text_hash": "83fb6713a008d4b0463fc0a677870c2fd31403204eab4cddf58358fa9165a0e8",
